Subject: [PATCH] Recompiler: function boundaries, resume entries and delay
 slots

Former patches of the series, merged:
- 0001: Decode the delay slot past a function end
- 0004: Register stub starts before resume entries
- 0033: Resume after a split delay slot
- 0047: Cut a Ghidra map function with a far chunk at the next function
